@startuml parking-sequence
title Request Parking — 池饱和时的请求暂存
skinparam shadowing false
autonumber

actor Client
participant "Envoy + ext_proc\n(atenet-router)" as gw
participant "ActorResumer\n(singleflight)" as res
participant "ate-api-server" as api

Client -> gw : "HTTP（目标 actor 处于 SUSPENDED）"
gw -> res : ResumeActor
note over res
  parking lot 准入：active < max(默认 1024)
  超限 → 立即 503 "router at capacity"
  同一 actor 的并发请求 singleflight 合并，
  共享一次控制面调用与剩余 budget
end note
res -> api : ResumeActor
api --> res : "FailedPrecondition:\nno free workers available"
note over res
  可停车条件：FailedPrecondition /
  Unavailable / Aborted
  指数退避 100ms × 1.1（无 cap，budget 封顶）
end note
loop "budget 内（默认 5s）"
  res -> api : 重试 ResumeActor
  api --> res : 仍无空闲 worker
end

alt "其他 actor 挂起，worker 释放"
  res -> api : ResumeActor
  api --> res : "RUNNING + worker 分配"
  res --> gw : 唤醒成功
  gw --> Client : "请求正常转发至 worker"
else "budget 耗尽"
  res --> gw : budgetExhausted（保留原始错误）
  gw --> Client : "503: no free workers available"
end

note over gw
  配套预算同步：ext_proc MessageTimeout = budget + 5s；
  ext_proc cluster 熔断 max_requests = 2×max（下限 1024），
  保证停车池永不挤占快路径（已 RUNNING actor 的请求）
end note
@enduml
